      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Crizanlizumab: STAND trial showed ⍉sig difference vs placebo; EMA authorisation revoked; still FDA-labeled to ↓vaso-occlusive crises, age 16 and older."
     }
    ]
